-on-trucks-autos", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_ff545f0f30966af7300c78df", "claim_ids": ["claim_38cbf59a0c95be65c5feb35a", "claim_7b6e19d713a58aeb2b1db313"], "query_ids": ["q_56"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_38cbf59a0c95be65c5feb35a", "quote": "Proclamation 10984 provides that automobile engine and MHDV engine manufacturers are eligible for an import adjustment offset amount equal to 3.75 percent of the aggregate value of all engines assembled in the United States by that manufacturer, as determined annually by Commerce.", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/07/29/2026-15280/procedures-to-administer-import-adjustment-offset-amounts-for-certain-imports-of-automobile-and", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "import adjustment offset amount", "duty_rate": "3.75 percent"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_7b6e19d713a58aeb2b1db313", "quote": "Year 1 (April 3, 2025 to April 30, 2026): Eligible manufacturers can apply for an offset equal to 3.75% of the aggregate Manufacturer's Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) of all U.S.-assembled vehicles", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/blog/section-232-auto-parts-tariffs", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "3.75%", "effective_date": "April 3, 2025", "expiration_date": "April 30, 2026"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_d0c6d045a498ddd358acd36e", "claim_ids": ["claim_38cbf59a0c95be65c5feb35a", "claim_b53f97ff0b95bcd515f2e205"], "query_ids": ["q_56"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_38cbf59a0c95be65c5feb35a", "quote": "Proclamation 10984 provides that automobile engine and MHDV engine manufacturers are eligible for an import adjustment offset amount equal to 3.75 percent of the aggregate value of all engines assembled in the United States by that manufacturer, as determined annually by Commerce.", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/07/29/2026-15280/procedures-to-administer-import-adjustment-offset-amounts-for-certain-imports-of-automobile-and", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "import adjustment offset amount", "duty_rate": "3.75 percent"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_b53f97ff0b95bcd515f2e205", "quote": "Import adjustment offset amounts will be calculated as follows: • 3.75% of aggregate MSRP for eligible autos assembled between April 3, 2025, and April 30, 2026", "url": "https://www.trade.gov/press-release/department-commerce-announces-new-auto-tariff-offset-process", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_fd3aa86264f4d3dfa50d691f", "claim_ids": ["claim_0946ecbc2b07fc6a228d2dc6", "claim_26c1980e9f19e5774d5edb1d"], "query_ids": ["q_60"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_0946ecbc2b07fc6a228d2dc6", "quote": "Section 232 is NOT recoverable; Section 301, MFN, and MPF/HMF are.", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/industries/automotive-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_26c1980e9f19e5774d5edb1d", "quote": "Duty drawback (mfg / substitution) | Yes — for exported vehicles and parts | Up to 99% of eligible duties/fees", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/industries/automotive-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Duty drawback (mfg / substitution)"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_303bd20a912120e7bcf2e9e0", "claim_ids": ["claim_0946ecbc2b07fc6a228d2dc6", "claim_536e350894dac5b970fd3672"], "query_ids": ["q_60"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_0946ecbc2b07fc6a228d2dc6", "quote": "Section 232 is NOT recoverable; Section 301, MFN, and MPF/HMF are.", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/industries/automotive-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_536e350894dac5b970fd3672", "quote": "Section 232 is NOT recoverable; Section 301, MFN, and MPF/HMF are. We estimate and file via a partner; no guaranteed amount.", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/industries/automotive-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_684009c9528de36d70306d4d", "claim_ids": ["claim_1f8ea5a58e8975a13ba524f8", "claim_26c1980e9f19e5774d5edb1d"], "query_ids": ["q_60"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_1f8ea5a58e8975a13ba524f8", "quote": "Section 232 tariffs (steel, aluminum, copper, automobiles): NOT ELIGIBLE for drawback. This is the major exception.", "url": "https://lightsource.ai/blog/duty-drawback-practical-guide-recovering-import-duties-2026", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 tariffs", "affected_product": "steel, aluminum, copper, automobiles"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_26c1980e9f19e5774d5edb1d", "quote": "Duty drawback (mfg / substitution) | Yes — for exported vehicles and parts | Up to 99% of eligible duties/fees", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/industries/automotive-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Duty drawback (mfg / substitution)"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_8788acb7d4cc558734a440ba", "claim_ids": ["claim_21ffb38fa8dd03df53db3508", "claim_26c1980e9f19e5774d5edb1d"], "query_ids": ["q_60"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_21ffb38fa8dd03df53db3508", "quote": "Section 232 tariffs (steel, aluminum, copper, automobiles): NOT ELIGIBLE for drawback. This is the major exception. If your primary imports are steel or aluminum, drawback does not apply to the Section 232 duties", "url": "https://lightsource.ai/blog/duty-drawback-practical-guide-recovering-import-duties-2026", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 tariffs", "affected_product": "steel, aluminum, copper, automobiles"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_26c1980e9f19e5774d5edb1d", "quote": "Duty drawback (mfg / substitution) | Yes — for exported vehicles and parts | Up to 99% of eligible duties/fees", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/industries/automotive-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Duty drawback (mfg / substitution)"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_a91366c72e889e5caa555644", "claim_ids": ["claim_26c1980e9f19e5774d5edb1d", "claim_317508d7bacf57870b356069"], "query_ids": ["q_60"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_26c1980e9f19e5774d5edb1d", "quote": "Duty drawback (mfg / substitution) | Yes — for exported vehicles and parts | Up to 99% of eligible duties/fees", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/industries/automotive-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Duty drawback (mfg / substitution)"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_317508d7bacf57870b356069", "quote": "Section 232 tariffs on steel, aluminum, copper, and automobiles are NOT eligible.", "url": "https://lightsource.ai/blog/duty-drawback-practical-guide-recovering-import-duties-2026", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "affected_product": "automobiles", "duty_rate": "NOT eligible"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_5af024d586eeb5444946f790", "claim_ids": ["claim_26c1980e9f19e5774d5edb1d", "claim_608bcf110c5d11ea96acd62e"], "query_ids": ["q_60"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_26c1980e9f19e5774d5edb1d", "quote": "Duty drawback (mfg / substitution) | Yes — for exported vehicles and parts | Up to 99% of eligible duties/fees", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/industries/automotive-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Duty drawback (mfg / substitution)"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_608bcf110c5d11ea96acd62e", "quote": "No drawback shall be available with respect to the duties imposed pursuant to this proclamation.", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2025/04/03/2025-05930/adjusting-imports-of-automobiles-and-automobile-parts-into-the-united-states", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "this proclamation"}}]}]}

